docs/architecture/*.png

# Secret material for k8s overlays (never commit).
# The db.env, auth_config.yaml and cviche-saml-sp-prod.*.pem files are committed
# as intentionally empty/placeholder content and stay tracked, so the overlays
# render from a clean checkout / CI (issue #108). Because they are tracked,
# these rules do NOT protect them: git ignores .gitignore for tracked paths, so
# a populated copy shows up as an ordinary modification and `git commit -a`
# would commit it. The protection is that buildspec.yaml never writes into the
# checkout: it renders secrets into a mktemp -d copy of k8s/ and applies that
# (#688). Do the same for any local render. These rules only keep NEW untracked
# key/cert files (e.g. a differently named *.key) out of `git add`.
k8s/overlays/*/db.env
k8s/overlays/*/auth_config.yaml
k8s/overlays/*/*.pem
k8s/overlays/*/*.key
k8s/overlays/*/*.crt

# Coverage artifacts (CODING_STANDARDS.md §6.10 -- reported, never committed)
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.json
coverage.xml
htmlcov/
